e appearance shape (surface shape) of a mobile unit without impairing the appearance of the mobile unit, which is relatively cheap and easily manufactured, and which is easily assembled and has excellent performance. The lens antenna is mounted on the mobile unit, the radiation-side face and the focal-point-side face of the lens antenna have quasi-optical shapes serving to form a lens, and the lens antenna has a shape of a body of revolution.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une antenne à lentille formée intégralement avec l'habillage (forme de surface) d'une unité mobile, sans que cela ne porte atteinte à l'esthétique de l'unité mobile. Ladite antenne à lentille, outre le fait d'être relativement bon marché et de fabrication aisée, est facile à assembler et présente d'excellentes performances. L'antenne à lentille est montée sur l'unité mobile, la face côté rayonnement et la face côté point focal de l'antenne à lentille ayant des formes quasi-optiques permettant la formation d'une lentille. L'antenne à lentille a la forme d'un corps de révolution.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>